arily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138686287", "author": {"steamid": "76561199396935531", "personaname": "СВЯЩЕННЫЙ РЫЦАРЬ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199396935531/", "num_games_owned": 71, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 205, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 205, "last_played": 1664809943, "avatar": "ba51fe1e269d44a1cd63c0579fb044a1a90d3e99"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Не покупайте эту игру за полную цену, разработчики сказали, что больше не будут обновлять новый контент.", "timestamp_created": 1684674665, "timestamp_updated": 1684674665, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138422074", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988142977", "personaname": "HouseM.D.[RU]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/housemdhouse/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 105377, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 76169, "last_played": 1775277764, "avatar": "f745f7ff13c85eedf840a6330ba6be8a265cf053"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Смысл был покупать года два назад,сейчас на игру положен болт разрабами.Больше никаких патчей и новых компаний.Нет что бы открыть доступ к модингу и люди бы делали сами карты,оружие,скины и прочее.Но нахер это надо.Не брать,не копейки эти ублюдкам.", "timestamp_created": 1684303755, "timestamp_updated": 1684303755, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.515394926071166992", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138395588", "author": {"steamid": "76561198151682159", "personaname": "п5 [SW]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198151682159/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1812, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 611, "last_played": 1695553493, "avatar": "b0373468015e5bcf9a08bb93b6e1c9705cd778f6"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Риммейк left 4 dead, только лучше во всех смыслах, игруха зашла одним словом. Графика обалденная, жаль русской озвучки нет, но не сильно страшно.", "timestamp_created": 1684267004, "timestamp_updated": 1684267004, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.440009176731109619", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138270547", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165874911", "personaname": "Patcher", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/patcher1/", "num_games_owned": 249, "num_reviews": 136, "playtime_forever": 1230, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 820, "last_played": 1769687706, "avatar": "5364a10a7cfe467d63c891b56b23ae1869e285f5"}, "language": "russian", "review": "На несколько часов игры сойдет, но до уровня Left 4 dead ей далеко.\n\nИз плюсов: отличная графика, большой выбор оружия и снаряжения.\nИз минусов: идея колод карт хороша, но тратить на это время желание нет. Мало разнообразия и миссий кампании.", "timestamp_created": 1684035987, "timestamp_updated": 1684078434, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.524404704570770264", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138170867", "author": {"steamid": "76561199259564435", "personaname": "Franko Huper", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/frankohuper/", "num_games_owned": 34, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1273, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 923, "last_played": 1684094176, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "russian", "review": "В кооперативе отлично.", "timestamp_created": 1683871630, "timestamp_updated": 1683871630, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138111375", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024036524", "personaname": "ScarecrowKZ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ScarecrowKZ/", "num_games_owned": 390, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 12, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12, "last_played": 1670104568, "avatar": "f94ee378e5b7c712001d1149c0d94d0dbb513239"}, "language": "russian", "review": "g o v n o", "timestamp_created": 1683753835, "timestamp_updated": 1683753835, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.482997387647628784", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 7, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "137969546", "author": {"steamid": "76561198237139136", "personaname": "FoReST", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Fprest/", "num_games_owned": 163, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 1620, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 578, "last_played": 1698840087, "avatar": "e27b48aabdc46f43f90719bf4b8a432ad57953f8"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Плюсы:\n- Графика.\n- Хороший кооператив \n- Кросс платформа\n- Карточная система (благодаря этой системе каждая локация это абсолютно новое сражение с массой изменений)\n- Отличная игра, если играешь на максимальной сложности\n\nНедостатки:\n- Не чувствуется урон по зомби, т.е. нету как говорят импакта от выстрелов, вроде попадаешь, но не чувствуешь что пуля попала по зомби, как будто пуля просто прошла сквозь тело.\n- Не реалистичные оружия, как будто держишь в руках пластмассовую игрушку, нету отдачи, если она есть то очень сильный разброс, у  минигана вообще скорость выстрелов не совпадает с выходом пуль с оружия. \n", "timestamp_created": 1683494332, "timestamp_updated": 1683494332, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494319796562194824", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "137969139", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033444041", "personaname": "Chrp🐼", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198033444041/", "num_games_owned": 240, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 402, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 248, "last_played": 1683580134, "avatar": "e32f95f5696ac657bde8069608c37871cd1268fa"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Лучше чем Deep Rock Galactic", "timestamp_created": 1683493724, "timestamp_updated": 1683493724, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.459363967180252075", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": fa